learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:1: trailing whitespace.
+Feature: A-S121 / D-S121 / SC-S121 Windows code-slot promotion rehearsal
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:2: trailing whitespace.
+  This is one frozen Kano S learning unit, not its native B sibling.
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:3: trailing whitespace.
+  Source S121: App Service, Windows code: Demonstrate prepared slot swaps
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:4: trailing whitespace.
+  with strict warm-up and compatible state.
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:5: trailing whitespace.
+  Source D-S121 requires actual code-slot configuration, strict readiness,
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:6: trailing whitespace.
+  state, and client outcomes evidenced on Windows. This lesson cannot fulfill it.
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:7: trailing whitespace.
+  All hosting, SKU, settings, slots, readiness, routing, and client receipts
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:8: trailing whitespace.
+  below are fixed fictional teaching DATA. No Azure operation is executed.
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:9: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:10: trailing whitespace.
+  Background:
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:11: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the banner is exactly "Training rehearsal - synthetic data - not a live Azure result"
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:12: trailing whitespace.
+    And the fictional Windows code fixture shares its teaching plan between two slots
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:13: trailing whitespace.
+    And production is the intended swap target, not the staging slot
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:14: trailing whitespace.
+    And native qualification, source-parent completion, and five-nines proof are always false
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:15: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:16: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Prepare before requesting promotion, then measure finished journeys
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:17: trailing whitespace.
+    When I select the ready fixture and explicitly acknowledge the synthetic boundary
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:18: trailing whitespace.
+    And I inspect its effective destination configuration and strict readiness receipts
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:19: trailing whitespace.
+    Then production-target, code/settings, warm-up path and statuses, dependencies,
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:20: trailing whitespace.
+      authentication, compatible state, and overlap capacity gates pass in the fixture
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:21: trailing whitespace.
+    When I request the fictional promotion
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:22: trailing whitespace.
+    Then desired routing changes but observed routing and completed-journey counts do not
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:23: trailing whitespace.
+    When I observe the fixed client receipts
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:24: trailing whitespace.
+    Then all three started journeys finish on the candidate with compatible identity/state,
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:25: trailing whitespace.
+      one committed effect each, no duplicate effects, and latency within the teaching budget
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:26: trailing whitespace.
+    And the result is an uninterrupted rehearsal only, never a native Windows result
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:27: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:28: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario Outline: Preparation fails closed without exposing transition clients
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:29: trailing whitespace.
+    When I configure "<fixture>" for "<target>"
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:30: trailing whitespace.
+    And I inspect the preparation receipts
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:31: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the preparation result is "<result>"
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:32: trailing whitespace.
+    And no promotion is available and no transition journey is counted successful
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:33: trailing whitespace.
+    Examples:
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:34: trailing whitespace.
+      | fixture            | target     | result     |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:35: trailing whitespace.
+      | ready              | staging    | safe-abort |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:36: trailing whitespace.
+      | declared-only      | production | unverified |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:37: trailing whitespace.
+      | shallow-200        | production | safe-abort |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:38: trailing whitespace.
+      | setting-mismatch   | production | safe-abort |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:39: trailing whitespace.
+      | incompatible-state | production | safe-abort |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:40: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:41: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Healthy HTTP is insufficient
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:42: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the shallow-200 fixture returns HTTP 200
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:43: trailing whitespace.
+    When I inspect preparation
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:44: trailing whitespace.
+    Then its failed dependency-aware readiness gate prevents promotion
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:45: trailing whitespace.
+    And a declared warm-up path and explicit acceptable statuses alone are not readiness proof
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:46: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:47: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario Outline: Wishes and partial receipts do not complete a journey
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:48: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the "<fixture>" fixture has passed the synthetic preparation gates
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:49: trailing whitespace.
+    When I request promotion and observe its fixed receipts
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:50: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the attempted/successful/interrupted/unknown counts are "<counts>"
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:51: trailing whitespace.
+    And failures and unknown started outcomes remain in the denominator and retained history
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:52: trailing whitespace.
+    And old-slot retention does not promise protection from former-worker recycling
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:53: trailing whitespace.
+    Examples:
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:54: trailing whitespace.
+      | fixture         | counts  |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:55: trailing whitespace.
+      | missing-routing | 3/2/0/1 |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:56: trailing whitespace.
+      | unfinished      | 3/2/0/1 |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:57: trailing whitespace.
+      | pinned-old      | 3/2/0/1 |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:58: trailing whitespace.
+      | recycled-worker | 3/2/1/0 |
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:59: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:60: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Strict commands and authentic immutable states
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:61: trailing whitespace.
+    When an input contains an unknown property, unknown fixture, unsupported target,
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:62: trailing whitespace.
+      getter, string acknowledgement, or out-of-order action
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:63: trailing whitespace.
+    Then it is rejected without changing state or retained history
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:64: trailing whitespace.
+    And a forged, mutated, or JSON-cloned state is not accepted as preparation evidence
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:65: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:66: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Actual keyboard, error, and reset behavior
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:67: trailing whitespace.
+    When I conduct the lesson with Tab, Space, and Enter
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:68: trailing whitespace.
+    Then each operator action has a label, visible focus, and announced results
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:69: trailing whitespace.
+    When I submit an invalid selection or omit acknowledgement
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:70: trailing whitespace.
+    Then a useful alert identifies the input and focuses a recoverable control
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:71: trailing whitespace.
+    When I reset
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:72: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the baseline, controls, acknowledgements, counters, and history are restored
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:73: trailing whitespace.
+    And no control named reset shadows the native form reset method
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:74: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:75: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Content security policy is enforced in the actual browser
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:76: trailing whitespace.
+    Given scripts and styles are local external files
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:77: trailing whitespace.
+    When the browser attempts inline script, inline event handling, evaluated script, or a connection
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:78: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the CSP blocks them and the observed violations are retained as local test evidence
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:79: trailing whitespace.
+    And ordinary verification never writes or replaces evidence
learning/S121/evidence/red/browser-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:80: trailing whitespace.
+    And only exact CAPTURE_BROWSER_EVIDENCE=1 deliberately captures a new browser record
