learning/S121/evidence/red/model-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:6: trailing whitespace.
+  state, and client outcomes evidenced on Windows. This lesson cannot fulfill it.
learning/S121/evidence/red/model-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:7: trailing whitespace.
+  All hosting, SKU, settings, slots, readiness, routing, and client receipts
learning/S121/evidence/red/model-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:8: trailing whitespace.
+  below are fixed fictional teaching DATA. No Azure operation is executed.
learning/S121/evidence/red/model-windows-slot-promotion.feature.snapshot:9: trailing whitespace.
