+    <ol id="history"></ol>
learning/S121/index.html:92: trailing whitespace.
+    <p>Invalid actions preserve the last valid state and history. Reset restores current output,
learning/S121/index.html:93: trailing whitespace.
+      selections, and acknowledgement but retains earlier receipts and the used allowance.
learning/S121/index.html:94: trailing whitespace.
+      Reload explicitly starts a fresh in-memory page session; nothing is a durable native record.</p>
learning/S121/index.html:95: trailing whitespace.
+  </section>
learning/S121/index.html:96: trailing whitespace.
+  <section aria-labelledby="native-heading">
learning/S121/index.html:97: trailing whitespace.
+    <h2 id="native-heading">What a native Windows claim would still need</h2>
learning/S121/index.html:98: trailing whitespace.
+    <ul>
learning/S121/index.html:99: trailing whitespace.
+      <li>Separate authorization and an owned Windows code target, supporting SKU/slot limits,
learning/S121/index.html:100: trailing whitespace.
+        region, configuration, immutable versions, and shared-plan overlap capacity evidence.</li>
learning/S121/index.html:101: trailing whitespace.
+      <li>Target-specific effective settings, including slot-specific/non-swapped properties,
learning/S121/index.html:102: trailing whitespace.
+        plus strict warm-up path/status and dependency, authentication, state, and latency receipts.</li>
learning/S121/index.html:103: trailing whitespace.
+      <li>A real swap record with production as target and actual destination/version receipts,
learning/S121/index.html:104: trailing whitespace.
+        not desired traffic weights, an HTTP-only probe, or a requested operation.</li>
learning/S121/index.html:105: trailing whitespace.
+      <li>Finished representative journeys with identity/state, latency, committed effects,
learning/S121/index.html:106: trailing whitespace.
+        duplicate/missing effects, unknowns, routing-cookie clients, and former-worker outcomes.</li>
learning/S121/index.html:107: trailing whitespace.
+      <li>Native prerequisite acceptance, independent verifier/user-impact/cleanup evidence,
learning/S121/index.html:108: trailing whitespace.
+        and appropriately qualified statistical evidence for any reliability claim.</li>
learning/S121/index.html:109: trailing whitespace.
+    </ul>
learning/S121/index.html:110: trailing whitespace.
+    <p>Documented Windows code swaps require a supporting plan, but this is not target
learning/S121/index.html:111: trailing whitespace.
+      qualification. Slots share compute; retaining an old slot does not prevent native
learning/S121/index.html:112: trailing whitespace.
+      swap worker recycling. A zero-traffic staging endpoint is not authorization.
learning/S121/index.html:113: trailing whitespace.
+      Linux/container native auto-swap exclusions are not borrowed as Windows proof.</p>
learning/S121/index.html:114: trailing whitespace.
